_**Performance Across Varying Time Budgets.**_ Table 3 represents the number of unique bugs detected by each tool when
different time-budget is given. As shown in the table, extending
the testing time may enhance the NPE detection ability of the unit
test generation tool; however, the improvement remains relatively
